aused only the order ID is returned in the initial response, with the order status being set to &quot;on hold&quot;. For orders in this state, you can continue to make updates to the order via the Prodigi dashboard. Once the pause window expires, a web-hook is triggered containing the full order details.</p>\n1480-\n1481-<p>Please refer to the <a href=\"#order-actions\" title=\"Order actions\">Order actions</a> section on more information about updating existing orders. Once an order passes into fulfilment, it can no longer be changed or cancelled.</p>\n1482-<h3 id='create-order-create-order-outcomes'>Create order outcomes</h3>\n1483-<p>In addition to the <a href=\"#outcomes-general-outcomes\" title=\"General outcomes\">General outcomes</a>, this endpoint can also return:</p>\n1484-\n1485-<table><thead>\n1486-<tr>\n1487-<th>Outcome</th>\n1488-<th>Status code</th>\n1489-<th>Description</th>\n--\n1543-            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Mr Test\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1544-            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"email\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1545-            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"phoneNumber\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1546-            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"address\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n1547-                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"line1\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"14 test place\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1548-                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"line2\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"test\"</span><span c