{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"toolshed_web_search","tool":"call_web_search","arguments":{"fast_mode":true,"web_search_instructions":"Using official Prodigi docs or credible current examples, identify a valid Prodigi v4 clothing t-shirt SKU supporting black color and S/M/L/XL. Return only likely SKU candidates and source URLs. Check if aa_mens_tshirt is real/current."},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Research Report: Prodigi v4 clothing t-shirt SKU supporting black color and S/M/L/XL sizes\n\n## Executive Summary\n\nProdigi offers a range of customizable t-shirts suitable for print-on-demand services, including options in black and sizes S, M, L, and XL. The SKU \"aa_mens_tshirt\" is not listed among Prodigi's current offerings, suggesting it may be outdated or discontinued.\n\n## Key Findings\n\n- **Finding 1:** Prodigi provides several t-shirt models available in black and sizes S, M, L, and XL, including the Bella+Canvas 3001 and Gildan 64000.\n\n- **Finding 2:** The SKU \"aa_mens_tshirt\" does not appear in Prodigi's current product listings, indicating it may no longer be in use.\n\n- **Finding 3:** Prodigi's t-shirt offerings include various styles such as classic, long sleeve, and triblend, catering to diverse customer preferences.\n\n- **Finding 4:** Some previously available products, like the Unisex T-Shirt Non-branded, have been discontinued, reflecting updates in Prodigi's product catalog.\n\n---\n\n## Detailed Source Analysis\n\n### Source 1: Print on Demand T-Shirts - Print API, Dropshipping\n\n- **URL:** ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/mens-clothing/t-shirts/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Domain:** prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official Prodigi website)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nProdigi offers a diverse selection of customizable t-shirts suitable for print-on-demand services. The available styles include activewear, classic, long sleeve, tank tops, triblend, baseball, polo, and V-neck. Notable models include the Bella+Canvas 3001 and Gildan 64000, both available in black and sizes S, M, L, and XL. These t-shirts are designed to accommodate various printing methods and customer preferences.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Product models: Bella+Canvas 3001, Gildan 64000\n\n- Available sizes: S, M, L, XL\n\n- Color options: Black, among others\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"Our carefully curated range of premium designer t-shirts are available in an array of on-trend styles and colours.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 2: Prodigi API Documentation\n\n- **URL:** ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Domain:** prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official Prodigi API documentation)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThe Prodigi API documentation provides detailed information on product attributes, including SKUs, descriptions, dimensions, and available variants. It outlines the parameters required for integrating Prodigi's products into external systems, emphasizing the importance of accurate SKU usage for order processing. The documentation does not reference the SKU \"aa_mens_tshirt,\" suggesting it is not part of the current product lineup.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Product attributes: SKU, description, dimensions, variants\n\n- SKU \"aa_mens_tshirt\" not listed\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"Use the lookups endpoints to find out more information on each SKU.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 3: Unisex T-Shirt Non-branded\n\n- **URL:** ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/mens-clothing/t-shirts/classic/unisex-t-shirt-non-branded/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Domain:** prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official Prodigi website)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThe Unisex T-Shirt Non-branded was a product offered by Prodigi, featuring no brand label in the collar and designed for customization. It was available in sizes S through 5XL and fulfilled from the UK with worldwide shipping. However, this product has been discontinued, indicating changes in Prodigi's product offerings.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Product status: Discontinued\n\n- Available sizes: S to 5XL\n\n- Fulfillment location: UK\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"This product is no longer available.\"\n\n---\n\n## Cross-Reference Analysis\n\n**Consensus Across Sources:**\n\n- Prodigi offers a variety of t-shirt models in black and sizes S, M, L, and XL, including the Bella+Canvas 3001 and Gildan 64000. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/mens-clothing/t-shirts/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- The SKU \"aa_mens_tshirt\" is not present in Prodigi's current product listings, indicating it may be outdated or discontinued. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Conflicting Information:**\n\n- No conflicting information was identified among the sources.\n\n**Information Gaps:**\n\n- Specific details about the SKU \"aa_mens_tshirt,\" such as its previous specifications or reasons for discontinuation, are not provided.\n\n- Information on potential replacement products for the discontinued Unisex T-Shirt Non-branded is not available.\n\n---\n\n## Research Metadata\n\n- **Search Completed:** 2026-08-25T22:40:40Z\n\n- **Sources Analyzed:** 3 sources\n\n- **Total Content Reviewed:** Approximately 1,200 words\n\n- **Search Confidence:** High (Based on source quality and coverage)\n\n--- "}],"_meta":{"openai/widgetSessionId":"e04151cb-86cd-4408-ad94-0e559091a05f"},"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
