> <span>Etsy</span> </div> </a> </li> <li class=\"ml-2 mb-1\"> <a href=\"#platforms\" class=\"text-xs\" title=\"All platforms\">+ 6 more</a> </li> </ul> </dd> </dl> <div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"mt-0 text-xs text-gray-600\"> * Prices exclude taxes and shipping. Non-GBP prices are approximate based on current rates. </p> <p class=\"mt-0 text-xs text-gray-600\">** Not all sizes available from all locations.</p> </div> </div> <div> <div class=\"mt-8\"> <p>Made from 100% cotton, the Bella+Canvas 3001 t-shirt offers natural stretch and a combed finish for a super-soft feel. </p> <p>Cut with a tailored fit, it features a crew neck, short sleeves and side seams to reduce twisting. </p> <p>Each piece is custom printed using direct-to-garment technology, ensuring super-sharp detail and vibrant, long-lasting colour, before being packaged and shipped directly to your customer. </p> <p>This product also supports extra features, including removable tags and multiple print areas. These are available at an additional cost, with details on pricing and availability explained in our <a href=\"https://www.prodigi.com/faq/products/#what-are-costed-assets\" title=\"FAQs\">FAQs</a>.</p> <p><strong>Please note: Fibre content varies by colour. Please see below for more information.</strong></p> </div> <div class=\"product__features\"> <ul> <li>Made from 100% cotton</li> <li>Combed and ring-spun</li> <li>Crew neck</li> <li>Short sleeves</li> <li>Side seams </li> <li>Tailored fit</li> </ul> </div> <div class=\"mt-8\"> Bella+Canvas 3001 t-shirts are part of our <a href=\"/products/unisex-apparel/\" title=\"Unisex apparel\">Unisex apparel</a> and <a href=\"/products/summer-essentials/\" title=\"Summer essentials\">Summer essentials</a> collections. </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"lg:w-3/5 pt-8 text-center\"> <ul class=\"product__gallery\"> <li class=\"product__gallery-item\"> <img src=\"/img/products/additional/bella-canvas-3001/bellacanvas3001-03.webp\" alt=\"Bellacanvas3001 03\"/> </li> 