{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_29","type":"agent_message","text":"The Prodigi sandbox key is valid, and the live catalog confirms `GLOBAL-TEE-BC-3001` (Bella+Canvas 3001) with black and S/M/L/XL variants. I’m using that SKU, sending the captured timestamp as a server-rendered PNG asset at a public route, and setting a Prodigi idempotency key derived from the Stripe PaymentIntent so retries remain safe."}}
